package main

// tack_version is the version tack --version prints, after "tack ": devel
// in every build of this tree as it is committed. A release, and only a
// release, rewrites this file in a copy of the tree before it builds the
// compiler from that copy, with the release's tag, vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH
// (see tools/release/stamp.sh), so that every stage of its bootstrap is
// built from the same source and stage 2 and stage 3 stay the same
// bytes. The committed file is never stamped.
var tack_version = "devel"
